interactive typing runs a command
disabled highlighting defers PATH work until TAB
history ghost hides entries whose command no longer resolves
history ghost suggests entries whose command resolves
completion menu keeps callback-owned strings alive
timed out help completion stops after two attempts
man subcommand indexing recovers after a timed out manpath command
quoted replacement and smart-case TAB preserve the completed token
Alt and Ctrl keys preserve word and line editing
clobbered PWD completion uses the actual directory
